WEBVTT

00:09:58.756 --> 00:10:03.676
Now, so many people understand
the urgency of the situation.

00:10:03.716 --> 00:10:07.756
We understand that new and now
go hand in hand.

00:10:07.796 --> 00:10:10.116
We can't sit around
waiting for a solution.

00:10:10.116 --> 00:10:13.396
We need to get out
and develop the ones we have

00:10:13.396 --> 00:10:15.676
while we invent the ones
we don't have yet.

00:10:16.436 --> 00:10:18.956
And none of this happens
without passionate people,

00:10:18.996 --> 00:10:22.716
and that's why I'm so excited,
so optimistic.

00:10:22.756 --> 00:10:24.916
I see it everywhere,

00:10:24.956 --> 00:10:27.276
from young people in the United States

00:10:27.276 --> 00:10:31.916
who refuse to work for a company
that isn’t committed to a clean future,